        "Content": "\nBedroom 3 - 2.21m x 2.96m\n\n\nHall - 1.75m x 4.26m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.98m x 3.02m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.95m x 3.70m\n\n\nKitchen - 1.60m x 4.96m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.30m x 3.89m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.48m x 3.18m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.17m x 1.71m\n\n\n"
